  "instance_name": "mocking_humor",
  "label": "mocking and belittling emotion",
  "description": "The emotion expressed is one of mocking and belittling, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the cheerful, lighthearted visual of two men laughing together and the overlaid text that promotes a misogynistic stereotype. The humor is not genuine or celebratory but rather sarcastic and demeaning, aimed at undermining the idea of women having power by suggesting they should be confined to the kitchen. This emotion is rooted in the misogynous stereotype and the misogynous humor trope.",
